  {
    "id": 1023004040070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……この雑誌って\r\n発売っていつ頃でしたっけ、ライブの前？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "えっと……\r\nちょうどライブと同じくらいの時期かな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そっか～……じゃあ\r\nワンマンライブのことはオンライン記事に載せてください！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "あはは、オッケー\r\n元々オンライン用にも記事は作る予定だから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "ライブ前にばっちり宣伝するね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040090,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "やは～\r\nありがとうございます！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040090"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00115",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "ライブに向けての準備って、\r\n例えばどんなことをしてるの？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "歌とかダンスのレッスンとかもそうなんですけど\r\n衣装とかメイクとか、セットのこととかにも意見を出してて",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "すごい！　じゃあ雛菜ちゃんプロデュースの\r\nステージになるってこと？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～……雛菜が全部決めてるってわけじゃないし\r\nこういうのがやりたい！　って言ってるだけで",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "本当にそれができるのかっていうのは\r\nプロデューサーさんとかスタッフさんが調整してくれてます",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でも、いつかは全部雛菜が考えました！\r\nっていうのをやってみたいな～って思ってます",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "うんうん、なるほど！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "こうやって色々なお仕事をさせてもらう中で\r\n今までよりもっと自分のすきがはっきりした気がして",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "新しくすきになったものもあれば\r\n今まですきだったものがもっとすきになったり",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "じゃあライブの演出以外でも\r\nやりたいことがあったりする？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "やりたい事はありすぎるくらいあって",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "なのに時間ってすぐ過ぎていっちゃうので\r\nもう終わりか～って思うことばっかりです",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
