  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、さすがに疲れたみたいだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～……\r\nそうだね～、撮影あっという間だったのに",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "レッスンしてからの撮影だったもんな\r\nでも、ワンマンライブの宣伝もできてよかったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だよね～\r\n雛菜すごい頑張った～……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\nワンマンライブに向けてのやる気を感じるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040210,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～、雛菜いつもやる気でしょ～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまんすまん、そうだったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040220,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でも、雛菜がユニットで活動してるって\r\n知らない人も結構いるみたいだから",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040230,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "特にああいうファッション誌を見てる人とか",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、色んな層の人に\r\n雛菜と、ノクチルのファンになってもらえるといいよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004040240,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "うん～！\r\nま、ライブに来てもらえるかはわかんないけど～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300404/1023004040240"
  },
